3. Scope — what this licence covers
-----------------------------------

This licence applies to the original StoreSplit material in this repository
(the source code, tests, configuration, and documentation authored for this
project), and only to the extent that the copyright holder owns rights in it.

It does NOT apply to, and grants no rights in:

  - Third-party dependencies. Nothing in this repository redistributes them;
    they are installed from their own sources and keep their own licences.

  - Reference data that is not the copyright holder's.
    `app/retailers/data/zip_centroids.csv` is the 2023 US Census ZCTA
    Gazetteer, a US Government work in the public domain.

  - Retailer-derived data. The vendored store directories, category seeds,
    and catalogue snapshots under `app/retailers/`, and the captured payload
    fixtures under `tests/fixtures/`, describe or reproduce data published by
    the named retailers. That data belongs to those retailers. Nothing here
    claims ownership of it, and this licence grants no rights over it.


